            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's happening here?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"requests.put(course_url, json=course_data)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"requests.delete(lesson_url)\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The code replaces a complete course record and then removes an old lesson</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The code replaces a complete course record</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The code removes an old lesson</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">The code partially edits the course but leaves every lesson intact</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The code replaces a complete course record and then removes an old lesson.</p></body></html>"
